Package: zipbrk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ZIP file format fuzzer and structural multi-tool
 zipbrk performs targeted structural mutations on ZIP archives: setting
 or clearing encryption flags, zeroing compressed/uncompressed size
 fields, XOR-ing header fields with a password-derived hash, and
 spoofing or restoring the PK magic signatures used by ZIP blockers.
 .
 Originally developed in 2004-2005 in response to CVE-2004-0932 and
 later expanded to probe InfoZip unzip for heap overflows and
 out-of-bounds reads. Addresses CVE-2004-0932, CVE-2014-8139,
 CVE-2014-8140, CVE-2014-8141, CVE-2015-7696, CVE-2015-7697, and
 CVE-2018-1000035.
